WEBVTT

00:07:27.125 --> 00:07:30.143
They allow their relationship pain
to get in the way.

00:07:30.167 --> 00:07:32.601
But at the end of the day,
we're on the same team,

00:07:32.625 --> 00:07:34.417
and that's Sekou's team.

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:37.434
You know, I have to admit,

00:07:37.458 --> 00:07:39.351
we have an unconventional relationship

00:07:39.375 --> 00:07:41.768
a lot of people don't understand.

00:07:41.792 --> 00:07:45.309
We're not perfect as parents or people.

00:07:45.333 --> 00:07:48.125
But we honor each other's role
in Sekou's life.

00:07:49.542 --> 00:07:51.768
We allow him to do things

00:07:51.792 --> 00:07:54.851
that our parents
would never allow us to do.

00:07:54.875 --> 00:07:58.667
We don't allow our fears
to put limits on him.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:03.184
We nurture his natural curiosity
about the universe